{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43540","headline":"中元日鲍端公宅遇吴天师联句 · 严维","name":"中元日鲍端公宅遇吴天师联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道流爲柱史，教戒下真仙。\n共契中元会，初修内景篇。\n游方依地僻，卜室喜墙连。\n宝笥开金籙，华池漱玉泉。\n怪龙随羽翼，青节降云烟。\n昔去遗丹竈，今来变海田。\n养形奔二景，链骨度千年。\n骑竹投陂里，携壶挂牖边。\n洞中尝入静，河上旧谈玄。\n伊洛笙歌远，蓬壶日月偏。\n青骡蓟训引，白犬伯阳牵。\n法受相君後，心存象帝先。\n道成能缩地，功满欲升天。\n何意迷孤性，含情恋数贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}